	(text "DN1: the Melzi, DN2: the tool (U1007),\nDN3: the plot bed board (J1002), DN4: the Aux\nMCU. DN1, DN2, DN4: data only, their VBUS\npads not connected. One TT: the full-speed\nMCUs share 12 Mbit/s; the Pi Zero tool\n(high speed) has the 480."
