	(text "The tool's USB-C cable (sheet Toolhead,\nW501; 3 A, USB 2.0): VBUS = +5V_TOOL\nafter F1001, D+/D- = DN2. The cable\ncarries the 5 V and the GND the FFC\ntakes to the coupling (1 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
